 from_table_name | to_table_name  | diff_type | data_change | schema_change 
-----------------+----------------+-----------+-------------+---------------
 app.f()         | app.f()        | modified  | f           | t
                 | app.fresh      | added     | f           | t
                 | app.g(integer) | added     | f           | t
 app.gone        |                | dropped   | f           | t
 app.keep        | app.keep       | modified  | f           | t
 app.mood        | app.mood       | modified  | f           | t
 app.old_name    | app.new_name   | renamed   | f           | t
 app.seq         | app.seq        | modified  | t           | f
 app.t           | app.t          | modified  | t           | f
 app.vw          | app.vw         | modified  | f           | t
(10 rows)

